# Two Libraries of Leng are two replacement effects, each with its own opportunity at a discarded card's move (CR 614.5,
# 616.1). Faithless Looting discards two Islands. For the first, Bot1 declines the first Library it applies and is then
# offered the second, which it takes: the Island goes on top of the library. For the second, Bot1 declines both, and it goes
# to the graveyard - asked once by each Library, and no more.
